{%- case field -%}
{%- when 'group' -%}wellness
{%- when 'wellness' -%}
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Who is it for? <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.who_is_it_for != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.who_is_it_for | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Someone with dandruff &amp; an itchy scalp<br> Teenagers &amp; kids who play or sweat regularly<br> Anyone with excess oiliness in the scalp<br> If you need a toxic chemical free shampoo for kids</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Ingredients <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.ingredients != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.ingredients | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Fresh Lime peels, Aloe Vera Gel, Vitamin E, Glycerine, Distilled Lemon water, Distilled Aloe Vera &amp; Neem water, Sweet Almond Oil, Cold pressed Coconut Oil, Sodium Cocyl Isothionate, Coco Glucoside, Lauryl Glucoside, Decyl Glucoside, Soap nut, Vitamin E, Pathanol (0.55%), Phenoxyethanol (0.35%), Geogard, Lemongrass Infused oil, Neem Infused oil, Euclayptus Infused oil, Peppermint Infused oil, Orange essential, Tea-Tre essential oil, Cold Pressed Sun Flower Oil.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>What is it? <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.what_is_it != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.what_is_it | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>This formula is good for balancing the pH of the scalp, reducing dandruff and keeping the scalp clean. It is very suitable for children and can form a good foundation for their scalp care. Lemon has Vit C, which strengthens hair follicles and has natural anti-bacterial action. If you are searching for a gentle shampoo to use after working out or playing, which can be used regularly, this is a great option.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>What makes it different <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.why_it_is_unique != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.why_it_is_unique | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>This shampoo is made in a soap base made with cold pressed oils instead of palm oil, which is commonly used by brands. It has no artificial thickeners or fragrance, and while the consistency is thinner than chemical shampoos, it is more effective in cleansing the hair. It uses Indic ingredients like lemon &amp; aloevera to enhance scalp health and retains the natural benefits of these ingredients as it is infused in brass vessels.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Disclaimer <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.disclaimer != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.disclaimer | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p>A patch test is mandatory. If the product or a natural ingredient irritates your skin, please stop using it immediately. Please consult your naturopath or physician before using these products.</p>{% endif %}</div></details>
{%- endcase -%}
